  itemName: Eclipsed Soul - Katana of the Fivefold Path
  itemIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e2abf7c6121adaf47a1a7c0b91d621ea, type: 3}
  itemDescription: "Crafted under a once-in-a-millennium eclipse, Eclipsed Soul is
    a katana imbued with all five primal forces \u2014 its blade shimmers with shifting
    hues of violet, blue, crimson, gold, and silver. Each swing resonates with the
    echoes of elemental balance, allowing the wielder to cut through flesh, soul,
    and spirit alike. Forged by an unknown master who vanished with the stars, this
    weapon is both an executioner's blade and a celestial key."
